   "end_sec": 10.942,
   "duration_sec": 4.741
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C10-D004",
   "turn_index": 3,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "ありがとうございます。リンさん、どれが欲しいですか。私は魚とご飯が欲しいです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C10-D004-S01",
    "C10-D004-S02",
    "C10-D004-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 11.292,
   "end_sec": 17.179,
   "duration_sec": 5.887
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C10-D005",
   "turn_index": 4,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "私は野菜とご飯が欲しいです。昨日は肉を食べました。野菜とご飯はいくらですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C10-D005-S01",
    "C10-D005-S02",
    "C10-D005-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 17.529,
   "end_sec": 25.239,
   "duration_sec": 7.71
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C10-D006",
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "九百円です。卵もありますね。魚とご飯は千円です。値段は税込ですよ。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C10-D006-S01",
    "C10-D006-S02",
    "C10-D006-S03",
    "C10-D006-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 25.589,
   "end_sec": 32.507,
   "duration_sec": 6.918
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C10-D007",
   "turn_index": 6,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "牛乳も欲しいです。マテオさんはコーヒーですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C10-D007-S01",
    "C10-D007-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 32.857,
   "end_sec": 36.632,
   "duration_sec": 3.775
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C10-D008",
   "turn_index": 7,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "今日はジュースだけ注文します。ここのコーヒーは私の口に合いません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C10-D008-S01",
    "C10-D008-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 36.982,
   "end_sec": 41.54,
   "duration_sec": 4.558
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C10-D009",
   "turn_index": 8,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "まずいですか。私はここのコーヒーが好きですよ。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C10-D009-S01",
    "C10-D009-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 41.89,
   "end_sec": 45.739,
   "duration_sec": 3.849
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C10-D010",
   "turn_index": 9,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "いいえ、ちょっと苦いです。今日はジュースが欲しいです。財布に二千円あります。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C10-D010-S01",
    "C10-D010-S02",
    "C10-D010-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 46.089,
   "end_sec": 51.812,
   "duration_sec": 5.723
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C10-D011",
   "turn_index": 10,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "私は千百円あります。野菜とご飯に牛乳をお願いします。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C10-D011-S01",
    "C10-D011-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 52.162,
   "end_sec": 57.5,
   "duration_sec": 5.338
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C10-D012",
   "turn_index": 11,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "すみません。魚とご飯を一つください。ジュースを一つください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C10-D012-S01",
    "C10-D012-S02",
    "C10-D012-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 57.85,
   "end_sec": 62.814,
   "duration_sec": 4.964
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C10-D013",
   "turn_index": 12,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "私は野菜とご飯を一つください。ご飯は少しだけください。牛乳も一つください。箸もお願いします。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C10-D013-S01",
    "C10-D013-S02",
    "C10-D013-S03",
    "C10-D013-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 63.164,
   "end_sec": 71.159,
   "duration_sec": 7.995
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C10-D014",
   "turn_index": 13,
   "speaker": "店の人",
   "source_text": "はい。魚とご飯は一つ、野菜とご飯も一つですね。ジュースは一杯、牛乳も一杯ですね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C10-D014-S01",
    "C10-D014-S02",
    "C10-D014-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-storyteller-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 71.509,
